    "title": "Combat Storyboard for RMU",
    "description": "A combat logger for RMU to generate human-readable combat reports and AI prompts. It translates raw combat data into token-efficient prompts. Use the dedicated GM wizard to refine your highlight reel, manage cast descriptions, and generate multi-page comic scripts via external AI tools. Note: This module does not contain any AI functionality itself, but is designed to work with external AI services.",
